{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08958","headline":"杂体五首 二 · 韦应物","name":"杂体五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古宅集祆鸟，羣号枯树枝。\n黄昏窥人室，鬼物相与期。\n居人不安寝，搏击思此时。\n岂无鹰与鸇，饱肉不肯飞。\n既乖逐鸟节，空养凌云姿。\n孤负肉食恩，何异城上鸱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08958.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08958","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}